%% Argus — 에이전트 실행부터 승인까지 (비동기 파이프라인)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor ENG as 설비 엔지니어 (ENGINEER)
  participant FE as FE (Vue, 화면 2)
  participant API as BE Router (FastAPI)
  participant ORCH as AgentOrchestrator
  participant AG as AgentService x4 (Mock/LLM)
  participant APS as ApprovalService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  actor SM as 안전관리자 (SAFETY_MANAGER)

  ENG->>FE: "에이전트 실행" 클릭
  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/work-requests/{id}/agent-runs
  API->>DB: work_requests 조회 (status 검증)
  alt status 가 APPROVED 또는 DONE
    API-->>FE: 409 Conflict
  else id 없음
    API-->>FE: 404 Not Found
  else 실행 가능
    API->>ORCH: start(work_request_id)
    ORCH->>DB: ai_configs 조회 (provider, model_name, prompt_version)
    ORCH->>DB: INSERT agent_runs (overall_status=RUNNING, steps 4개 PENDING)
    ORCH->>DB: UPDATE work_requests.status = RUNNING
    API-->>FE: 202 Accepted {run_id, overall_status:"RUNNING"}
    FE->>FE: 타임라인 4카드 = 대기, 3초 폴링 시작
  end

  loop 3초 폴링 (Mock: 호출마다 step 1개 DONE)
    FE->>API: GET /api/v1/agent-runs/{runId}
    API->>ORCH: get_run(runId)
    ORCH->>AG: 다음 step 실행 (SPEC → LEGAL → SAFETY_DOC → VENDOR)
    AG-->>ORCH: step.result JSON (status=DONE)
    ORCH->>DB: UPDATE agent_runs.steps_json, legal_findings / documents 저장
    ORCH-->>API: AgentRun
    API-->>FE: 200 AgentRun (steps[].status)
    FE->>FE: 해당 카드 대기 → 실행 중 → 완료
  end

  Note over ORCH,DB: 4 step 모두 DONE → summary, approval_required_by=SAFETY_MANAGER 작성
  ORCH->>DB: UPDATE agent_runs.overall_status = REVIEW, completed_at
  ORCH->>DB: UPDATE work_requests.status = REVIEW
  FE->>API: GET /api/v1/agent-runs/{runId}
  API-->>FE: 200 AgentRun (overall_status=REVIEW)
  FE->>FE: 폴링 중단, 승인 요청 UI 활성화

  ENG->>FE: 누락 정보 입력 (documents[].missing), "승인 요청" 클릭
  FE->>API: PATCH /api/v1/work-requests/{id}/submit-approval
  API->>DB: latest_run 및 missing 검증
  alt missing 남음
    API-->>FE: 422 Unprocessable Entity
  else run 미완료 (RUNNING / FAILED)
    API-->>FE: 409 Conflict
  else 검증 통과
    API->>DB: UPDATE work_requests.status = PENDING_APPROVAL
    API-->>FE: 200 WorkRequest
  end

  SM->>FE: 화면 2 승인 패널 열람 (applicable_laws, required_procedures, 서류 초안)
  FE->>API: GET /api/v1/work-requests/{id}
  API-->>FE: 200 WorkRequestDetail (latest_run, approvals)
  SM->>FE: 체크리스트 4항목 확인, 코멘트 입력, "승인" 클릭
  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/work-requests/{id}/approvals {decision:"APPROVE", checklist, comment}
  API->>APS: decide(work_request_id, approval)
  APS->>APS: 상태 검증 (PENDING_APPROVAL) + 체크리스트 게이트
  alt checklist 4항목 중 false 존재 (APPROVE)
    APS-->>API: ChecklistIncomplete
    API-->>FE: 409 Conflict
  else 게이트 통과
    APS->>DB: INSERT approvals (decision, checklist_json, comment, decided_at)
    APS->>DB: UPDATE work_requests.status = APPROVED
    APS->>DB: INSERT audit_logs
    APS-->>API: Approval
    API-->>FE: 201 Created Approval
    FE->>FE: 상태 배지 APPROVED, 대시보드 avg_approval_hours 갱신
  end
